{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coin Factory is a relaxing money-making game where you'll embark on a journey to wealth. Combine and level up factories, explore numerous synergies at your own pace, and unlock multiple tiers of buildings.<br><br>Coin Factory 2 takes the idle strategy to the next level. Introducing a new 3d engine and new systems &amp; mechanics that will make every run a challenge. Tiles can level up and also evolve. Choose the path you consider the best or explore as many as you can.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758400?t=1761148349","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758400/20959d2dfa247f3bea956cfc401df079f7a4152c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761148349","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758400/f0f98db44c645b22094f9fbf954f68c98a0d131f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761148349","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758400/f0f98db44c645b22094f9fbf954f68c98a0d131f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761148349","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coin Factory is a relaxing money-making game where you'll embark on a journey to wealth. Combine and level up factories, explore numerous synergies at your own pace, and unlock multiple tiers of buildings.<br><br>Coin Factory 2 takes the idle strategy to the next level. Introducing a new 3d engine and new systems &amp; mechanics that will make every run a challenge. Tiles can level up and also evolve. Choose the path you consider the best or explore as many as you can.</p>","developers":["Lino Rabolini"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"I